  Talk:
  - Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4083b8134ca747f68837268d2bd45653, type: 2}
      Text: I brought the last of the biscuits.
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f8985f554ea4c9c84e248e9b8be1859, type: 2}
      Text: And I brought an appetite. We are well matched.
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4083b8134ca747f68837268d2bd45653, type: 2}
      Text: Mind the sand in the butter.
  - Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1812e1b614eb4f5da2ad5be5808f804f, type: 2}
      Text: Water is flat as a plate tonight.
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5b26b6a8c5154f86b2ea4b17e2511e1f, type: 2}
      Text: It will not last. Eat while it does.
  - Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f8985f554ea4c9c84e248e9b8be1859, type: 2}
      Text: We should do this more.
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5b26b6a8c5154f86b2ea4b17e2511e1f, type: 2}
      Text: You say that every time.
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f8985f554ea4c9c84e248e9b8be1859, type: 2}
      Text: And I am right every time.
  WaitsOn: 
